Description: AI-powered video generation application that creates videos from text prompts
 AI Video Generator is a modern web application that transforms text descriptions
 into stunning videos using cutting-edge artificial intelligence technology.
 .
 Features:
  - Generate videos from detailed text prompts
  - Multiple video styles (Cinematic, Animated, Realistic, etc.)
  - Customizable duration (5-60 seconds)
  - High-quality output up to 4K resolution
  - Local storage persistence for video history
  - Real-time progress tracking
  - No installation required - works in any browser
  - Responsive design for all devices
Section: web
Priority: optional
Depends: 
Suggests: firefox | chromium-browser | google-chrome-browser
